Omar, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.266
Your One Word, I really,
really, really appreciate it

00:05:26.266 --> 00:05:28.108
and hope you're enjoying the read.

00:05:28.108 --> 00:05:29.632
Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:05:29.632 --> 00:05:30.722
I believe in you.

00:05:30.722 --> 00:05:32.774
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:05:32.774 --> 00:05:34.520
and whatever your one word is,

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.264
much love and I'll see
